/-!
# Lemma 7.47.2

The complete-lattice structure is upstream mathlib API.  The generated-sieve
universal property is owned by `ReasLib.CategoryTheory.Sites.Sieve`.
-/

/- Lemma 7.47.2 (00YZ): sieves on an object form a complete lattice, and the
sieve generated by a family of arrows is the least sieve containing that family. -/
@[stacks 00YZ] #check @CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows_isLeast

#check CategoryTheory.Sieve.instCompleteLattice
#check @CategoryTheory.Sieve.sSup_apply
#check @CategoryTheory.Sieve.sInf_apply
#check @CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows
#check @CategoryTheory.Sieve.ofArrows_mk
#check @CategoryTheory.Sieve.top_apply
#check @CategoryTheory.Sieve.bot_apply
